    {
      "y": 73.76881408691406,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 个人信息主体不授权同意使用、关闭或退出特定业务功能的，不应频繁征求个",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 89.54336547851562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "人信息主体的授权同意；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 104.98878479003906,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 个人信息主体不授权同意使用、关闭或退出特定业务功能的，不应暂停个人信",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 120.74331665039062,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "息主体自主选择使用的其他业务功能，或降低其他业务功能的服务质量；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 136.1887969970703,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "f) 不得仅以改善服务质量、提升使用体验、研发新产品、增强安全性等为由，强",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 151.94332885742188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "制要求个人信息主体同意收集个人信息。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 175.98895263671875,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5.4 收集个人信息时的授权同意",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 199.09658813476562,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 214.1887969970703,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 收集个人信息，应向个人信息主体告知收集、使用个人信息的目的、方式和范",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 229.94332885742188,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "围等规则，并获得个人信息主体的授权同意；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 246.92897033691406,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注1：如产品或服务仅提供一项收集、使用个人信息的业务功能时，个人信息控制者可通过个人信息",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 262.5290222167969,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "保护政策的形式，实现向个人信息主体的告知；产品或服务提供多项收集、使用个人信息的业",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 278.1589660644531,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "务功能的，除个人信息保护政策外，个人信息控制者宜在实际开始收集特定个人信息时，向个",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 293.7590026855469,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "人信息主体提供收集、使用该个人信息的目的、方式和范围，以便个人信息主体在作出具体的",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 309.3589782714844,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "授权同意前，能充分考虑对其的具体影响。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 324.67095947265625,
      "size": 9.0,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注2：符合5.3和 a）要求的实现方法，可参考附录C。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 339.0187683105469,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "b) 收集个人敏感信息前，应征得个人信息主体的明示同意，并应确保个人信息主",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 355.1266174316406,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "体的明示同意是其在完全知情的基础上自主给出的、具体的、清晰明确的意愿",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 370.37335205078125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "表示；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 385.81878662109375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "c) 收集个人生物识别信息前，应单独向个人信息主体告知收集、使用个人生物识",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 401.9266052246094,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "别信息的目的、方式和范围，以及存储时间等规则，并征得个人信息主体的明",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 417.17333984375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "示同意；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 432.0533447265625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "注：个人生物识别信息包括个人基因、指纹、声纹、掌纹、耳廓、虹膜、面部识别特征等。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 448.2187805175781,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "d) 收集年满14周岁未成年人的个人信息前，应征得未成年人或其监护人的明示同",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 463.99334716796875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "意；不满14周岁的，应征得其监护人的明示同意；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 479.43878173828125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "e) 间接获取个人信息时：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 495.03875732421875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1) 应要求个人信息提供方说明个人信息来源，并对其个人信息来源的合法性",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 510.7933654785156,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "进行确认；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 526.23876953125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2) 应了解个人信息提供方已获得的个人信息处理的授权同意范围，包括使用",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 541.9932861328125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "目的，个人信息主体是否授权同意转让、共享、公开披露、删除等；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 557.4387817382812,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "3) 如开展业务所需进行的个人信息处理活动超出已获得的授权同意范围的，",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 573.546630859375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "应在获取个人信息后的合理期限内或处理个人信息前，征得个人信息主体",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 588.7933349609375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "的明示同意，或通过个人信息提供方征得个人信息主体的明示同意。",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 612.8389282226562,
      "size": 10.5600004196167,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "5.5 个人信息保护政策",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": true,
      "heading_score": 1.0
    },
    {
      "y": 635.5933837890625,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "对个人信息控制者的要求包括：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 651.0687866210938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "a) 应制定个人信息保护政策，内容应包括但不限于：",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 666.6687622070312,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "1) 个人信息控制者的基本情况，包括主体身份、联系方式；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 682.268798828125,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "2) 收集、使用个人信息的业务功能，以及各业务功能分别收集的个人信息类",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 698.0233154296875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "型。涉及个人敏感信息的，需明确标识或突出显示；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 713.46875,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "3) 个人信息收集方式、存储期限、涉及数据出境情况等个人信息处理规则；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 729.0687866210938,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "4) 对外共享、转让、公开披露个人信息的目的、涉及的个人信息类型、接收",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
    {
      "y": 744.8193359375,
      "size": 11.039999961853027,
      "bold": false,
      "text": "个人信息的第三方类型，以及各自的安全和法律责任；",
      "src": "line",
      "role": "body",
      "heading_candidate": false,
      "heading_score": 0.0
    },
